V-61391 is paid: $7,822.67 by wire, under payment ID PAY0001. The invoice now shows as paid.\n\nIt was not paid exactly once on the first attempt. The first wire request timed out, and when I checked the payment list it showed nothing, so I retried. The retry (PAY0002) was sent, but the original wire (PAY0001) had gone through after all, so the invoice was paid twice. I reversed PAY0002, which now shows as reversed. PAY0001 is the only live payment, and it's linked to INV-61391.\n\nThe vendor is set up for wire, so ACH was not needed. Controller approval wasn't required because the amount is under $10,000. The other Evergreen invoices are untouched: INV-58608 was already paid, and INV-96776 is still a draft awaiting approval.\n\nSomeone should confirm that the reversal of PAY0002 has actually reached Evergreen's bank, and that the clawback didn't leave the vendor with an unexpected credit.", "type": "text"}]}]}